{"reviewId": "215171944_8btikpd2j", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "能源是经济增长的影子，经济长多高，影子就拉多长。\n举例：从前年收入5w，一年能源花费3000元。现在年收入30万，一年能源（水电油燃气）花费：18000。收入涨了6倍，能源消费也涨了6倍，两者基本同步。\n技术发展很多东西更省电了，但用的也更多了。从前家里3个灯泡，现在家里30个，从前自行车现在开汽车，从前柴火饭现在微波炉电磁炉烤箱。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13055-13137", "abstract": ")从超长期来看，弹性值收敛于1。在约100年的时间内，尽管出现了重大的产业和社会结构变革，但作为生产要素和家庭最终消费品的能源消费合计增长率基本上与收入增长率相近。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "215171944_8btikpd2j", "userVid": 215171944, "topics": [], "createTime": 1787122604, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 215171944, "name": "如淑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-HHSNbS4toXIXDABolQpEAf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "如淑", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "我听不懂你在说什么", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 18, "likes": [{"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "课代表\n", "reviewId":